<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>نبض كورة</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Cairo,sans-serif}
body{background:#0a0e1a;color:#fff;padding-bottom:20px}
header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0f172a,#16a34a);padding:16px;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
.m{background:#162032;border:1px solid #ffffff12;border-radius:14px;padding:10px;margin:10px auto;max-width:600px}
.t{font-size:11px;opacity:.6;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.l{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.team{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.team img{width:24px;height:24px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;object-fit:contain}
.sc{background:#0f172a;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}
.time{font-size:11px;background:#0f172a;padding:6px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #22c55e22}
.time b{color:#22c55e}
.news{background:#162032;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:10px auto;max-width:600px}
.news-item{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff10}
.news-item img{width:85px;height:60px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover;background:#0f172a}
.news-item .txt{flex:1}
.news-item .txt b{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;display:block}
.news-item .txt span{font-size:11px;opacity:.5}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:800">⚽ نبض كورة</div><div style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7">بتوقيت المغرب والعالم العربي</div></header>

<div class="m">
<div class="t"><span>📅 اليوم - السبت 25 أكتوبر</span><span style="color:#ef4444">● مباشر</span></div>
<div class="l"><div class="team"><img src="https://media.api-sports.io/football/teams/1069.png">الوداد</div><div class="sc">1 - 1</div><div class="team">الرجاء<img src="https://media.api-sports.io/football/teams/1067.png"></div></div>
<div class="time">🇲🇦 <b>20:00</b> | 🇩🇿 20:00 | 🇪🇬 21:00 | 🇸🇦 <b>22:00</b> | 🇦🇪 23:00</div>
</div>

<div class="m">
<div class="t"><span>📅 غدا - الأحد 26 أكتوبر</span><span style="color:#ef4444">● مباشر</span></div>
<div class="l"><div class="team"><img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F83.png">برشلونة</div><div class="sc">2 - 0</div><div class="team">ريال مدريد<img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F86.png"></div></div>
<div class="time">🇲🇦 <b>21:00</b> | 🇩🇿 21:00 | 🇪🇬 22:00 | 🇸🇦 <b>23:00</b> | 🇦🇪 00:00</div>
</div>
